US-056 is implemented, but I can't mark it complete. The one open acceptance item is the `linux-gcc` gate, and this host can't run it.

**What's in the tree:** `ScriptRunner` (`engine/script/src/script_runner.cpp`) runs create, start, fixed_update, update, and destroy in a documented order. Each instance has its own Lua environment. A callback error faults only that instance and goes to the console queue. Reload preserves exports or resets state, and a syntax error on reload leaves the running instance untouched. Event subscriptions carry an owner tag and are released with the instance. `tests/src/script_lifecycle_tests.cpp` has 15 unit-labelled cases.

